      options: ['The role’s access to sensitive sites, records and remains carries a level of responsibility that periodic vetting helps safeguard appropriately', 'Security vetting is relevant only to roles directly involved in national defence', 'Once initially appointed, an officer’s suitability for continued access never needs any further review', 'Vetting requirements apply only to officers handling classified government documents'], correct: 0,
